Example styles:
```css
table {
  width: 50%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
}
th, td {
  border: 1px solid black;
  padding: 8px;
  text-align: left;
}
th {
  background-color: lightblue;
}
tr:nth-child(even) {
  background-color: lightgray;
}
```

Use CSS media queries to apply styles at different screen widths. Example:
```css
.container { width: 90%; margin: auto; }
@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .container { width: 100%; }
  .columns { display: block; }
}
```
